  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第四关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "...It's getting darker and darker."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "It's as if the clouds are pressing into the skyline..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "The air still feels clear, but the dark clouds aren't moving. It feels like all the stress is being compressed into a single point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Even the wind has stopped..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "No doubt about it. A Catastrophe is about to befall this city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "By the looks of things, Chernobog has been completely paralyzed by Reunion's attacks."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "But when it comes to disabling a nomadic city, the preparations must have been made several weeks in advance."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Could Reunion have taken some other action since then...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "That's a bit unrealistic."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "Based upon what we've seen, Reunion currently doesn't show the kind of discipline required to stage a covert takeover."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Most Reunion members are still wandering the streets, taking revenge on Chernobogians."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "It's all just senseless fighting, killing, and arson."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "When the Catastrophe falls, even the impregnable Chernobog will be shattered..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "...and turn into Originium-filled ruins."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "If fame or fortune is what they're after, Reunion is doomed to failure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Even with Ursus's chain of command in shambles, I still doubt that Reunion is able to face their military..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Why hasn't the Ursus military staged a counterattack yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "From my experience, when a riot breaks out, the military usually manages to quash it immediately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "But we did just witness the Ursus guards getting overpowered..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "That masked Reunion leader might have been a cut above the rest... but there's no way she could single-handedly destroy the entire city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Unless..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Unless what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "I've fought in many battles before..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "I've seen many people who acted in the same way as that Reunion leader."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "To them, soldiers are nothing more than pawns to be tossed away as soon as they've served their purpose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Soldiers could be used efficiently when needed, and then left to their own devices when not needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Because the cost of training and maintenance is too high."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "So, there's no standing army?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Right. Most of the time, they simply have to be fed with some hatred or fear..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "All that's needed to whip them into a frenzy... is a little push."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "If the way that Reunion leader acted was any indication for how the organization is run..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Any Infected could join Reunion simply by donning a uniform and putting on a badge?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Correct.."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "So... that explains their endless numbers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "There are too many oppressed Infected, desperately trying to cry out. No matter how tenuous the solutions that Reunion offers them might be..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "As long as they see a light at the end of the tunnel, they will gladly lay their lives down to pursue it, even if it means jumping into a sea of hellfire."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Ugh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dobermann",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "They are not like us. Even if I don't fully trust you, I at least trust your abilities."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "And completely unlike you..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "That kind of leader is no commander."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Those who would trample enemies and comrades alive... or rather, 'minions.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Perhaps not even minions. To Reunion, those thugs may have been nothing more than pawns."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "This is not a leader, but a tyrant."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "No matter who our enemies are, we will complete our mission."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "Someone once taught me and my teammates--"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "'If facing a pawn, capture it; If facing a fortress, topple it; If facing the Crown, overthrow it.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Ace, wait a minute."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, enemy light-armored troops are stationed in front of us."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Have we been found?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "Not yet."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "However..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
          "text": "We won't be able to avoid them. The route we're on is the shortest one; if we take a detour, we'll lose time we don't have."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "No need for further discussion then. Thugs or pawns, all that matters is that we clear them out of our way!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
